# WRITE TO NOR CLEAN of a 4 MB game (Hello.gba padded), through the
# menu's test hook: the progress bar halfway under the game's name,
# "Writing to NOR" with no percentage, and full with "Done" before the
# dialog closes (source/progress.h)
#! sd-file /Big.gba 0x400000 tests/roms/hello/hello.gba
-w "nav: home ready"
-P "@8:nav_test_path:/Big.gba" -p @8:nav_test_action:3
-w "screen ready: progress"
-s @760:half.png
-w "nor: list saved"
-s @6:done.png
